  "post_content": "<p>El Bar Ca Joanet Onda f&uacute;tbol sala ha ganado este s&aacute;bado 4-2 al Restaurant Ribarrupea FS Riba-roja, en partido del grupo 14 de la 3&ordf; divisi&oacute;n nacional jugado en el Polideportivo Municipal.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_4247.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Los ondenses est&aacute;n en la parte baja de la tabla, pero esperan ganar los pr&oacute;ximos partidos y asegurar su permanencia es esta categor&iacute;a nacional.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4247.jpg\" alt=\"img_4247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4248.jpg\" alt=\"img_4248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4249.jpg\" alt=\"img_4249\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4250.jpg\" alt=\"img_4250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4251.jpg\" alt=\"img_4251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4252.jpg\" alt=\"img_4252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4253.jpg\" alt=\"img_4253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/img_4256.jpg\" alt=\"img_4256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/futbolsala3adivisioonda/